Package: libpolkit-gobject-1-0
Version: @DEB_POLKIT_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/polkit/polkit
Depends: libglib2.0-0
Description: PolicyKit authorization API
 Client library for the polkit authority. Library-only build: there is no
 polkitd on this system; the library is present so PolicyKit-aware programs
 like GNOME Shell can load and run.
